<title>UK: Banco Excel Economico launches $150 mln Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Banco Excel Economico launches $150 mln Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Excel Economico SA has launched a $150 million Eurobond eight-year Eurobond with calls and puts after three and five years, lead manager Indosuez Capital said on Wednesday. No other terms were announced. Final pricing was due later.</p>
<p>The bank was formed earlier this year after Banco Excel acquired the assets of failed bank Banco Economico SA.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
